From 2422d5741db0f947939e33f01e2e949730c8c562 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cameron Kaiser <classilla@floodgap.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:30:02 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Add PPC64LE dynamic recompiler backend
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Restore the dynrec backend for little-endian 64-bit PowerPC hosts
(POWER8 and later) on top of dosbox-staging v0.83.0.

- risc_ppc64le.h: PPC64LE code generator for the dynrec core, based on
  Cameron Kaiser's PowerPC backend
- POWER10 (PowerISA 3.1) fast paths, detected at runtime via
  AT_HWCAP2: prefixed pli/paddi for 64-bit materialisation, add-imm and
  32-bit loads; DOSBOX_DRC_NO_ISA31=1 forces the portable path
- Fix the gen_and_imm high-halfword mask
- Nop op[0] when eliminating CMP/TEST stanzas
- CMake: select the dynrec core for ppc64le/powerpc64le hosts
  (C_TARGET_CPU_PPC64LE), and use the 64 KiB host page size
- Execution tests for the code generator (dynrec_ppc64le_tests.cpp)

Co-authored-by: Trung Lê <8@tle.id.au>
---
 CMakeLists.txt                     |   15 +-
 src/cpu/core_dynrec.cpp            |    3 +
 src/cpu/core_dynrec/risc_ppc64le.h | 1096 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/dosbox_config.h.in.cmake       |    1 +
 src/misc/support.h                 |    4 +-
 tests/CMakeLists.txt               |    1 +
 tests/dynrec_ppc64le_tests.cpp     |  461 ++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 1578 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/cpu/core_dynrec/risc_ppc64le.h
 create mode 100644 tests/dynrec_ppc64le_tests.cpp

